control: A body the port or the conversion refuses is recorded refused, never scanned, and not fetched again
removes: the record of what a job kind did with a message records a refused message as nothing, so it stays pending and is fetched again
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill/pass2
tests: TestABodyRefusedIsRecordedRefusedAndNotFetchedAgain TestARefusalReturnsToPendingOnlyWhenItsBoundChanges
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes
